$ Factorial calculation algorithm; by Gemini AI (2.5 Pro)

#1 main

    $ --- Cell creation ---
    41 -1 0 $ Cell to store the user-input number (n)
    41 -2 0 $ Cell to store the result (factorial)
    41 -3 0 $ Loop counter cell (will decrease from n to 1)
    41 -4 0 $ Constant cell with value 1 (for loop comparison)
    41 -5 1 $ Cell to store the name of the loop block
    41 -6 1 $ Cell for the input prompt string
    41 -7 1 $ Cell for the result prefix string

    $ --- Cell initialization ---
    04 -4 1
    04 -5 "factorial_loop"
    04 -6 "Enter a number: "
    04 -7 "Factorial is: "

    $ --- Main logic ---
    $ 1. Request user input
    02 -6  $ Print "Enter a number: "
    03 -1  $ Read the number into cell -1

    $ 2. Prepare for the loop
    26 -3 -1  $ Copy the input number (n) to the counter (-3)
    04 -2 1   $ Initialize the result (-2) with one

    $ 3. Start the loop
    35 -5  $ Start an endless call to the block whose name is in cell -5 ("factorial_loop")

    $ 4. Print the result (this code will execute after the loop finishes)
    02 -7  $ Print "Factorial is: "
    02 -2  $ Print the value of the result cell

#0


#1 factorial_loop

    $ --- Loop body ---
    $ 1. Check the exit condition: if the counter (-3) is less than or equal to 1, exit
    18 -3 -4  $ If (-3 <= -4)...
    42        $ ...then terminate the block/loop (break)

    $ 2. Main action: multiply the current result by the counter value
    07 -2 -3  $ result (-2) = result (-2) * counter (-3)

    $ 3. Decrement the counter by 1
    10 -3      $ Decrement cell -3

    $ The loop repeats because it was called by command 35

